# Task 479: /app is a pretty URL over the suite, which still lives at /engcalcs/.
# Internal rewrite, no R flag, so the address bar keeps /app. Both /app and /app/
# are matched: ecSwMounts() declares the mount as '/app/', a person types '/app'.
#
# SCRIPT_NAME under this rule is /engcalcs/Looped-Network.php, so ec_canonical_url()
# emits the long URL. Making /app canonical is a CODE change, not a server one --
# ROADMAP 479.01.
#
# NO `Options` LINE HERE, DELIBERATELY. An Options directive where AllowOverride
# Options is not granted returns 500 for EVERY request under this path, with no
# partial symptom. The ./engcalcs symlink relies on SymLinksIfOwnerMatch instead.
RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^app/?$ /engcalcs/Looped-Network.php [L]
